  "content": "\n\n# ✨ 聊天動畫\n\n* 透過加入流暢動畫來提升聊天介面的視覺效果。\n* 可選擇隱藏訊息左側的提示線。\n* 在 Fabric 上可透過 [Mod Menu](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu) 進行模組設定。\n\n<div>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/chatanimation/versions?l=fabric\">\n    <img alt=\"Fabric downloads\" height=\"54\" src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.jsdelivr.net%2Fnpm%2F%40intergrav%2Fdevins-badges%403%2Fassets%2Fcozy%2Fsupported%2Ffabric_vector.svg&amp;n=-1\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/chatanimation/versions?l=neoforge\">\n    <img alt=\"NeoForge downloads\" height=\"54\" src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.jsdelivr.net%2Fgh%2FHyperbole-Devs%2Fvectors%40neoforge_badges%2Fassets%2Fcozy%2Fsupported%2Fneoforge_vector.svg&amp;n=-1\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/chatanimation/versions?l=forge\">\n    <img alt=\"Forge downloads\" height=\"54\" src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.jsdelivr.net%2Fgh%2FHyperbole-Devs%2Fvectors%40neoforge_badges%2Fassets%2Fcozy%2Fsupported%2Fforge_vector.svg&amp;n=-1\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<img width=\"80%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DnNYdJsx/images/fd431cb3c6f7b0ac326f4ca861311cce7bb8c37d.gif\"></img>\n\n<img width=\"80%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DnNYdJsx/images/e6e59f7d4eccfda4d3d9be80900256afa91b5f11.png\"></img>\n\n<br>\n\n歡迎查看我的其他模組：[Smooth Gui](https://modrinth.com/mod/smooth-gui)",
